        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Upon formal notification of a decision involving substantive academic judgments, the complainant or United Academics may, within 10 days after receipt of such official notification, file an appeal with the chancellor. If the appeal is of a decision involving promotion, tenure, or non-retention, the appeal shall be referred by the chancellor to the Appeals Board Chair as provided in Article 7.3.3. Appeals of all other decisions involving academic judgments shall be referred by the chancellor to the chief academic officer as provided in Article 7.3.2. All appeals must include the following:",
